WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.457
- Hi, my name is Emmy Eaton,

00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:10.457
and my favorite thing to
do in my hometown, Idaho,

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.540
is I like potatoes

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.250
and then eat them.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.882
There are more than million
potatoes made each day.

00:00:17.882 --> 00:00:20.130
Yummy, yummy, yummy.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:22.860
Except I don't like it
when they're all dirty.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.240
We walked into the room

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.310
where there were a bunch of potatoes

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.920
and there was like a conveyor belt

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:32.250
that was holding up the potatoes.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.413
It shot water everywhere in there.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.100
And then we got to the
big stack of potatoes.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:42.480
They have to wait one
year in the big room.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.160
They have to keep it nice and cool,

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.920
so there's sand everywhere and stuff,

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.070
'cause they don't want it
to go rotten and moldy,

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:51.744
'cause that's gross.

00:00:51.744 --> 00:00:54.327
(upbeat music)

00:00:56.149 --> 00:00:56.982
- Hi, Drew.

00:00:56.982 --> 00:00:57.815
My name is Simone,

00:00:57.815 --> 00:01:00.870
and I am in my hometown
of Baltimore, Maryland.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:01.800
I love Baltimore

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.590
because it has so much
history and so much beauty,

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:07.440
but the thing I love most
here is the food scene.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:08.940
I'm a food blogger here in the area,

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:12.900
so I post all the best eats
and drinks in Baltimore.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:16.740
So I wanna show you around
to some of Baltimore's

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:20.197
most fun, and exciting, and
delicious foodie destinations.

00:01:20.197 --> 00:01:21.390
(upbeat music)

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:23.970
- First stop is Belvedere Square Market.

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:27.120
Say hello to my friends
at Neopol Savory Smokery.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.220
In general, they sell all
kinds of smoked goods,

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:33.720
but Neopol sells my favorite
sandwich in Baltimore,

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:35.370
their salmon BLT

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:38.580
and their famous New
Zealand smoked mussels.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:41.700
These are a must-try here in Baltimore.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.940
Last stop at Belvedere Square
Market is Tasha Flowers.

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:46.920
I come to Tasha to get my bouquets

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:49.650
for my living room, kitchen,
bedroom for the week.

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.020
- So we're gonna grab
this Asiatic lily here

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:52.853
because look at that.

00:01:52.853 --> 00:01:54.036
- Yes.
- It is beautiful,

00:01:54.036 --> 00:01:55.410
perfectly open.
- Uh-huh.

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:58.160
- That's just a little peek
of Belvedere Square Market.

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:01.140
Now moving onto our second stop,

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:04.830
welcome to chat hour at
Good Neighbor coffee shop.

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:05.663
We'll have some

00:02:05.663 --> 00:02:09.450
very creative appetizers,
great conversation.

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:11.340
Well, Drew, that's just a small look at

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.990
