00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:14.760
I hope you loved it as much as I do

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.350
and I hope to see you here soon.

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:17.183
Bye!

00:02:17.183 --> 00:02:20.010
(upbeat music)

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:20.843
- Hey, Drew.

00:02:20.843 --> 00:02:21.676
